'''''Hulk and the Agents of S.M.A.S.H.''''' is an American [[animated television series]] based on the [[superhero]] [[Hulk|character]] by [[Marvel Comics]]. The series premiered on August 11, 2013, on [[Disney XD]] as part of the ''[[Disney XD#Current|Marvel Universe]]'' block, and ended on June 28, 2015.<ref>{{cite web|last=Ng|first=Philiana|title=Disney XD's 'Avengers Assemble,' 'Hulk' Get Premiere Dates|url=http://www.hollywoodreporter.com/live-feed/disney-xds-avengers-assemble-hulk-426809|newspaper=[[The Hollywood Reporter]]|date=March 8, 2013}}</ref><ref name="Cast 2"/><ref name="How to fail upwards!">{{Cite web|url=http://askwacker.tumblr.com/post/123898441743/so-is-hulk-and-the-agents-of-smash-done-no-season|title = How to fail upwards!}}</ref>

==Plot==
The story is told from the perspective of an online [[reality television|reality show]] created by [[Rick Jones (character)|Rick Jones]] to foster public acceptance of the [[Hulk]] as a hero and not a monster. The "show" is filmed by [[Unmanned aerial vehicle|drones]] that accompany the Agents of the Supreme Military Agency of Super Humans (S.M.A.S.H.) everywhere they go.

Hulk, [[She-Hulk]], [[Thunderbolt Ross|Red Hulk]], Rick as A-Bomb, and [[Skaar (character)|Skaar]] come together as the Agents of S.M.A.S.H. to tackle threats that no other superheroes can face. The Agents have their base near the town of Vista Verde (where Bruce Banner first became Hulk) and face numerous villains, most prominently the [[Leader (character)|Leader]]. Early in the series, Skaar is revealed to be a [[Mole (espionage)|mole]] for the Leader, but the Agents eventually convince him to reform.

In Season Two, upon their return to Earth following their fights with the [[Kree]] and the [[Skrull]], the Agents of S.M.A.S.H. are hunted by [[S.H.I.E.L.D.]] and the military after the Leader frames them. After proving their innocence, the Agents of S.M.A.S.H. deal with the Leader traveling back in time to alter history, followed by an invasion from the Kree in retaliation for the incarceration of [[Ronan the Accuser]].

